  "access_token": "PASTE_YOUR_LONG_LIVED_TOKEN_HERE",
  "_note": "Copy this file to data/secrets.instagram.json and paste the long-lived token from the Meta app dashboard. Every build refreshes it and rewrites this file, so the 60-day expiry rolls forward as long as you build at least once inside the window. Gitignored. To keep it encrypted at rest instead, see 'Secrets' in README.md — set SECRETS_KEY and run npm run secrets:encrypt."
